ide-by-side as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x-a)^{2}+(y-b)^{2} & ={r}^{2} \\\\ (x-7)^{2}+(y-10)^{2} & =100 \\\\ (x-7)^{2}+(y-10)^{2} & ={10}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe see that $a=7,$ $b=10,$ and $r=10.$ \n\nTherefore, the circle is centered at $(7,10)$ and its radius is $10.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-117086/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "89462485-2e28-5727-82c7-7afd0cac6d77"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-117086"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-70900/selection/7a4f5b41f617c14e5f2f7099968e7afc9a04333bad61704ecf249c1e857dc253" :answer/id #uuid "928d6022-02e6-5a33-8084-ff7c3881479e" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "The center is $(-2,2)$ and radius is $3$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70900/selection/b15d96ef4b6972752a1bed814d028ed1b76c6488ab460417b90504ef8b73c422" :answer/id #uuid "269dba1d-aaf8-51bb-bd02-07928e4762f8" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "The center is $(2,-2)$ and radius is $3$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70900/selection/810418bd259f200aa41c6bcb86387387334fdd3181b49ad4248044e5fbbaf3f8" :answer/id #uuid "d5b27677-e195-517a-abca-ae920075b849" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "The center is $(-2,-2)$ and radius is $3$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70900/selection/4d5fb6cf9ee1aa5fd93cd99dfcb105a80c187a7dd5ba9db7e7f561c2e0738977" :answer/id #uuid "bdd0842e-1ce0-5258-a9a8-ecaec85ac848" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "The center is $(2,2)$ and radius is $3$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70900/selection/f47eee47dbd0146d68fba636fa72333979acdee62527c36bc3cc62ecca28bdaa" :answer/id #uuid "1ea2d03f-54fe-5fb9-9342-67cca9e0fe8c" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "The center is $(2,-2)$ and radius is $9$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70900/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "08171778-95eb-5a51-87a9-7deef383fa57" :an