quation of a circle with radius $r$ centered at the point $(a,b)$ is \n\n$$\n(x-a)^{2}+(y-b)^{2}={r}^{2}.\n$$\n\nLet's compare the general equation to our equation side-by-side as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x-a)^{2}+(y-b)^{2} & ={r}^{2} \\\\ (x+1)^{2}+(y+6)^{2} & =16 \\\\ (x-(-1))^{2}+(y-(-6))^{2} & ={4}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe see that $a=-1,$ $b=-6,$ and $r=4.$ \n\nTherefore, the circle is centered at $(-1,-6)$ and its radius is $4.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-70933/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "89462485-2e28-5727-82c7-7afd0cac6d77"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-70933"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-117087/selection/b2d921853533b4d33cd5bc3506d86285c7781d33437723388bc2847ae643a2e8" :answer/id #uuid "a9c57e0b-6b19-5f9f-9367-d74ab0f37a11" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "The center is $(-5,0)$ and the radius is $\\sqrt{3}$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-117087/selection/06bda481f22e721fc5a3649a3da1216b516c1b75da697317e0830efebe0195f4" :answer/id #uuid "518852c5-510b-5f4a-a8df-53eaa8b01cd0" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "The center is $(5,0)$ and the radius is $\\sqrt{3}$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-117087/selection/8f39269bc2ff1c4da22e1b5f9212a4a1f9ea7c3b8284df8ff3c005a6bb663f09" :answer/id #uuid "30970835-c892-55be-ad54-7fb37e3f61ff" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "The center is $(-5,0)$ and the radius is $3$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-117087/selection/528e9246d7673b607fd6605c752f684039ff7cb1e1dc408365f145d363e4e9c8" :answer/id #uuid "a0049175-38b5-5bde-8b3e-2488ef285eb6" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "The center is $(5,0)$ and the radius is $3$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-117087/selection/89fa7b17f6d16f73c4da5d95bc5b72397ecd1ea96ab27bf9cdf61c36284fc3fe" :answer/id #uuid "831161d5-63c4-5eeb-9710-be42aeca89fc" :answer/type