dius $r$ centered at the point $(a,b)$ is \n\n$$\n(x-a)^{2}+(y-b)^{2}={r}^{2}.\n$$\n\nLet's compare the general equation to our equation side-by-side as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x-a)^{2}+(y-b)^{2} & ={r}^{2} \\\\ (x-2)^{2}+(y-3)^{2} & =6 \\\\ (x-2)^{2}+(y-3)^{2} & =(\\sqrt{6})^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe see that $a=2,$ $b=3,$ and $r=\\sqrt{6}.$ \n\nTherefore, the circle is centered at $(2,3)$ and its radius is $\\sqrt{6}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-72617/selection/d29231e0ff5d013ade4b516c2c2e1ea9b96fe146a90a1bd28f98e51211efb977" :answer/id #uuid "5329b3f3-04d8-5b22-a178-80f402d51aeb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(x+2)^{2}+(y-3)^{2}=5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72617/selection/ca39033cc355c26b7d00a4bddbb111b49c03ec4f49d3eebb0ccb73aead575f50" :answer/id #uuid "bce9b963-8e52-5e9a-8a14-31b657090624" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(x+2)^{2}+(y-3)^{2}=25" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72617/selection/d1b2ad18662fa040ccb7adacf248c3ec5f16f35b80d3003d3d14581581cd3191" :answer/id #uuid "11a37dd0-0513-5f0b-9116-37fb01ba0cb9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(x-2)^{2}+(y-3)^{2}=\\sqrt{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72617/selection/9f306316d15d533e76bd67df1828772bcca4da3cc531809f3502efcd53573027" :answer/id #uuid "364be488-cc65-51d2-bf5f-735476c2a208" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(x-2)^{2}+(y-3)^{2}=25" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72617/selection/b48fb67d4ddeab94f6903df8345d7297ced2851bfc3ede7ecec5d7a169dfef76" :answer/id #uuid "98e98b9d-0935-5cca-88e9-89320e8fef5b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(x-2)^{2}+(y-3)^{2}=5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72617/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "e16dee8f-c8a1-5d21-9ac9-06a75dd2c5e3" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-72617/selection/ca39033cc355c26b7d00a4