lty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-117099/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3520d323-c6a4-5bce-bac1-1f4c02bd0068"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-117099"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-117105/selection/ecdef65622cb2c5b61c2bb157c11a4bebf14c668bd0818c7c6f3dbddce962fea" :answer/id #uuid "2bd44eae-a19d-5cf2-9cdc-51831cdfa588" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(x+1)^{2}+(y+1)^{2}=5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-117105/selection/773a009e35a819077c887e45173a9b8c9142ee2e7ce5b59bab5f05863943c965" :answer/id #uuid "a26e2b32-fee0-597e-9e56-263730960963" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(x-1)^{2}+(y-1)^{2}=5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-117105/selection/bf8bb15b13111a14f5df4a71a983966fee20a6168e8e9753484435f463a3c532" :answer/id #uuid "b84da13f-9d9c-502d-ab74-8e7b750cae26" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(x+1)^{2}+(y+1)^{2}=20" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-117105/selection/16c3630d03a8f6bbae3914c3ca4ae55c9a1b297820cb792e59b6a05fb4c00775" :answer/id #uuid "0814f275-f75f-5ec9-99d9-83e597093544" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(x+1)^{2}+(y-1)^{2}=5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-117105/selection/7e9a3ea28916de8b91a810729d3747d85c5d42555d10156196d867a1df1a69b0" :answer/id #uuid "747ce6f0-19ab-5c1f-ad13-c79a7c038494" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(x-1)^{2}+(y-1)^{2}=20" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-117105/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "b058ce2f-0721-515d-9477-d40ab526c4fa" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-117105/selection/ecdef65622cb2c5b61c2bb157c11a4bebf14c668bd0818c7c6f3dbddce962fea" :answer-field/choices ["q-117105/selection/ecdef65622cb2c5b61c2bb157c11a4bebf14c668bd0818c7c6f3dbddce962fea" "q-117105/selection/773a009e35a819077c887e45173a9b8c9142ee2e7ce5b59bab5f05863943c965" "q-117105/selection/bf8bb15b13111a14f5df4a71a983966fee20a6168e8e9753484435f463a3c532" "q-117105/selection/16c3630d03a8f6bbae3914c3ca4ae55c9a1b297820cb792e59b6a05fb4c00775" "q-117105/selection/7e9a3ea28916de8b91a810729d3747d85c5d42555d10156196d867a1df1a69b0"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-117105" :question/id #uuid "4fd2bbd4-f33a-5da0-b616-cd8d532ede0a" :question/math-academy-id "q-117105" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13957423/assets/0598fca48db1dbfb0cacadcf2ffb5cd987fc4e922fe85585849763fedac1f28e.png)\n\nThe line segment $\\overset{―}{XY}$ is a diameter of a circle. Given that $X$ and $Y$ have coordinates $(-3,0)$ and $(1,-2)$, respectively, what is the equation of the circle?" :question/worked-solution "The general equation of a circle with radius $r$ centered at the point $(a,b)$ is\n\n$$\n(x-a)^{2}+(y-b)^{2}={r}^{2}.\n$$\n\nUsing the distance formula to compute the distance between the points $X(-3,0)$ and $Y(1,-2),$ we find that the length of the diameter is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}XY & =\\sqrt{(-3-1)^{2}+(0-(-2))^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{4}^{2}+{2}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{16+4} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{4\\cdot 4+4} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{4\\cdot 5} \\\\  & =2\\sqrt{5}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo the radius of the circle is \n\n$$\nr=\\frac{2\\sqrt{5}}{2}=\\sqrt{5}.\n$$\n\nSince the center of a circle is the midpoint of the diameter, to find the center we use the midpoint formula as follows:\n\n$$\n(\\frac{{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}}{2},\\frac{{y}_{1}+{y}_{2}}{2})=(\\frac{-3+1}{2},\\frac{0-2}{2})=(-1,-1)\n$$\n\nSo our circle has radius $r=\\sqrt{5}$ and center $(a,b)=(-1,-1),$ and therefore it is represented by the following equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x-a)^{2}+(y-b)^{2} & ={r}^{2} \\\\ (x-(-1))^{2}+(y-(-1))^{2} & ={(\\sqrt{5})}^{2} \\\\ (x+1)^{2}+(y+1)^{2} & =5\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-117105/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "47863922-b0d5-5a0b-8a01-ffefe3b3c929"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-117105"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-117102/selection/fefd7661e62ae5ddc8f4d4c231d791ebe2a4a940077bfadf8632d368027f2655" :answer/id #uuid "4bf1063a-4822-5732-b173-baa2897cb947" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(x-2)^{2}+(y-2)^{2}=4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-117102/selection/55619c194c0e450905425ccaa2c2be59265f4fa01a69ee9e5b5086fc469f4cd7" :answer/id #uuid "d4c29e47-a8f4-5409-bc86-bdcee9cbdc7c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(x-2)^{2}+(y+2)^{2}=4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-117102/selection/6724a3f222b1612f6c7161f7998003773d87c671167d3e6f884182745f7b3d0a" :answer/id #uuid "d0a2bda7-6165-5b83-a53c-22a793385f9e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(x+2)^{2}+(y+2)^{2}=4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-117102/selection/061cdfcd369320d605d33a835915c2db25247207d6f33ca75449880e107fc59d" :answer/id #uuid "8134b51b-f613-5790-ada1-c4789cfe3223" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(x-2)^{2}+(y-2)^{2}=16" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-117102/selection/ad732bbdb5ff59be1bac56eb6e233d4b22dd7767a5ceaef6a26bb33f6abb65c1" :answer/id #uuid "26dc191b-e72d-58ea-a1aa-815d90144fb3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(x+2)^{2}+(y+2)^{2}=16" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-117102/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "ae7f31de-c8d5-5358-8ec4-ce90c4c9173b" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-117102/selection/fefd7661e62ae5ddc8f4d4c231d791ebe2a4a940077bfadf8632d368027f2655" :answer-field/choices ["q-117102/selection/fefd7661e62ae5ddc8f4d4c231d791ebe2a4a940077bfadf8632d368027f2655" "q-117102/selection/55619c194c0e450905425ccaa2c2be59265f4fa01a69ee9e5b5086fc469f4cd7" "q-117102/selection/6724a3f222b1612f6c7161f7998003773d87c671167d3e6f884182745f7b3d0a" "q-117102/selection/061cdfcd369320d605d33a835915c2db25247207d6f33ca75449880e107fc59d" "q-117102/selection/ad732bbdb5ff59be1bac56eb6e233d4b22dd7767a5ceaef6a26bb33f6abb65c1"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-117102" :question/id #uuid "fa1c4c37-ff9c-598a-8a03-e5747428c73c" :question/math-academy-id "q-117102" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13957423/assets/afd2f435a60fbb5a0f0f83c5f8965a74ca107d1ed4b14d03401f7966a323d2f1.png)\n\nThe line segment $\\overset{―}{XY}$ is a diameter of a circle. Given that $X$ and $Y$ have coordinates $(2,4)$ and $(2,0)$, respectively, what is the equation of the circle?" :question/worked-solution "The general equation of a circle with radius $r$ centered at the point $(a,b)$ is\n\n$$\n(x-a)^{2}+(y-b)^{2}={r}^{2}.\n$$\n\nUsing the distance formula to compute the distance between the points $X(2,4)$ and $Y(2,0),$ we find that the length of the diameter is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}XY & =\\sqrt{(2-2)^{2}+(4-0)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{0}^{2}+{4}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{16} \\\\  & =4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo the radius of the circle is \n\n$$\nr=\\frac{XY}{2}=\\frac{4}{2}=2.\n$$\n\nSince the center of a circle is the midpoint of the diameter, we can find the center using the midpoint formula as follows:\n\n$$\n(\\frac{{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}}{2},\\frac{{y}_{1}+{y}_{2}}{2})=(\\frac{2+2}{2},\\frac{4+0}{2})=(2,2)\n$$\n\nSo our circle has radius $r=2$ and center $(a,b)=(2,2),$ and therefore it is represented by the following equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x-a)^{2}+(y-b)^{2} & ={r}^{2} \\\\ (x-2)^{2}+(y-2)^{2} & ={2}^{2} \\\\ (x-2)^{2}+(y-2)^{2} & =4\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-117102/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "47863922-b0d5-5a0b-8a01-ffefe3b3c929"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-117102"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-70990/selection/97a6c2d7397374e808227e3d9600b818ed527ed4346931e99669ea